(</rp><rt>そ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">爸爸在洗手间刮胡子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">反る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">そる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">翘起；弯曲；拱起；弓起；向后弯曲；反向弯折</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那个；它；那时；那个时间点；那里；你</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191835\">わたしはそれを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てぎょっとした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我吓了一跳。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それから</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">然后；之后</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205929\">それからすっきりきれいにしてくれ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那就好好洗干净吧</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それぞれ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">各自；分别；各个</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144663\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはそれぞれ<ruby>向<rp>(</rp><rt>む</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ru