/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">而且；另外；也；即便如此</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"531277\">それと<ruby>俺<rp>(</rp><rt>おれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がホモだとしたら、<ruby>罪<rp>(</rp><rt>つみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるわけ？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果我是同性恋,那是犯罪吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それとも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">或者；还是</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"11459441\">トムはやるの？それともやらないの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汤姆做不做?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">其れ共</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">それとも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\"><span lang=\"en\">or；or else</span></span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それなのに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">然而；尽管如此；可是；但即便这样；不过；虽然</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104610\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い、それなのに<ruby>分別<rp>(</rp><rt>ふんべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他很年轻,却很谨慎</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">而且；此外；另外；还有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205709\">それに、みんなに<ruby>仲間<rp>(</rp><rt>なかま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もできるしね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">并且,我们得到对方的公司启动。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">それほど</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那种程度；那么多；那样地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228507\">いや、それほど<ruby>混<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでなかったよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不 交通还不错</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">其れ故</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">それゆえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">因此；所以；由于这个原因</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204782\">それゆえここにとどまらざるを<ruby>得<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ないだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">因此,我必须呆在这里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逸れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">それる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">转向；偏离；躲开；错过（如目标）；偏离；离题；脱离正轨；走神</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"